---
// How a project goes. This content is a real sequence, so the steps are
// counted and drawn as a marked trail (painted blazes on a dashed path).
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="f-section f-process" data-f-trail aria-labelledby="f-process-title">
  <div class="f-wrap">
    <div class="f-process__head" data-f-reveal>
      <h2 class="f-h2" id="f-process-title">How a project goes</h2>
      <p class="f-lede">
        Four steps, the same every time. You always know where we are, what's next and what it
        costs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="f-steps">
      <li class="f-step" data-f-reveal style="--d:0.0s">
        <span class="f-blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="f-step__count">Step 1</span>
        <h3 class="f-h3">Talk</h3>
        <p>
          A short call about your business, your customers and what isn't working today. No
          prep needed.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="f-step" data-f-reveal style="--d:0.1s">
        <span class="f-blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="f-step__count">Step 2</span>
        <h3 class="f-h3">Plan</h3>
        <p>
          We map the pages, the content and the one thing the site has to do. You get a written
          scope and a price before design starts.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="f-step" data-f-reveal style="--d:0.2s">
        <span class="f-blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="f-step__count">Step 3</span>
        <h3 class="f-h3">Design and build</h3>
        <p>
          You see real pages early and give feedback as we go. Nothing ships until you've
          approved it.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="f-step" data-f-reveal style="--d:0.3s">
        <span class="f-blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="f-step__count">Step 4</span>
        <h3 class="f-h3">Launch and grow</h3>
        <p>
          We launch, watch how people use the site, and keep improving the parts that bring in
          customers.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
